{"availability":"available","full":"Nideesh1/agentglow","name":"agentglow","description":"Make your AI agents look pretty","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T01:18:19Z","updated":"2026-10-08T19:48:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://nideesh1.github.io/agentglow/","topics":["agents","long-horizon-agents","long-running-agents","mcp","mcp-server","opentelemetry"],"demo":"https://nideesh1.github.io/agentglow/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T10:32:01.165Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T10:32:01.165Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T10:32:01.165Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T10:32:01.165Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2107128653750415498","postId":"2107128653750415498","postedAt":"2026-10-05T15:19:54.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T16:30:39.655Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T10:32:01.165Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Watch your AI agents work live, in 3D, from the OpenTelemetry they already emit.","Live demo: all 7 themes with simulated agents, right in your browser (no install).","Agents spawn as glowing shapes, pulse on every LLM call, fan out to subagents, query MCP servers and databases, and fade when they finish. Since 0.4.0 the backend around them shows up too: services, requests, queues, jobs and resources, in the same scene. One line of Python (or Node). Works with LangChain, LangGraph, deepagents, OpenAI Agents SDK, Hatchet, MCP, FastAPI, FastStream, Next.js / Node, and Claude Code itself."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Nideesh1/agentglow/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f2a89b15d504dd823b6a426070c3217f05d354152b24290bd380133ed9f97347","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T08:18:46.723Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T10:32:01.165Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Watch your AI